    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:279032b9a8cfdd3ecb2b97b09b121ead2318572419b58df6272731348c2f93b3",
      "request_id": "279032b9a8cfdd3ecb2b97b09b121ead2318572419b58df6272731348c2f93b3",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6f51a8eda94757c1e066833ab555d876",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "接下来九分，他拿了七分，七比四赢下抢七。可抽筋倒地，为什么还会被警告？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "1fa2d9cc2f5748f73d9c34b56b9da696700a8c36d5797b095f48b12993e16761",
      "words_sha256": "bf3b1cb4432fb79300ed4861d3b6d31bcffdad3015d58e8e68a36760e6a67d62"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:2865cd4e370845d288f3d2e0976337adcaf8972f04cf34d1900b165182ebc8d2",
      "request_id": "2865cd4e370845d288f3d2e0976337adcaf8972f04cf34d1900b165182ebc8d2",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6e0dcdd193b75daf491686cf1f0a3cbe",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这条规则，不少球员都碰上过。二零二一年迈阿密，梅德韦杰夫第三盘抽筋，一瘸一拐，最后七比六、六比七、六比四赢下波皮林。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "88a431d8c7b4316a045d03c0c326339afbe73adbf86c9687bfa71cc89657227f",
      "words_sha256": "8a840ca04a1e293fbdbe02770554223ca8a6c69b1e79becfabf307c72c46fc00"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:30a1792d2c291e024c8ae0fb36d9037e4fca3fb4c81c24879ed3611f11be06a9",
      "request_id": "30a1792d2c291e024c8ae0fb36d9037e4fca3fb4c81c24879ed3611f11be06a9",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8d6599ee1432880f25b7f38af2154897",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二二年阿卡普尔科，科兹洛夫对季米特洛夫。第二盘，他打着打着就抽筋了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d7428c7269dd5ccd97cba7392cf4d715efd5d84cfb808738edfa529ed9d34be4",
      "words_sha256": "f5fa855e27bd19018f79d344175ba3a96c50e7c783756c1cddf5ae4ba6a5731f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:31067b82829d5ac39a37ab224b7047671351ad314e222de70a60a101ea1ac5b1",
      "request_id": "31067b82829d5ac39a37ab224b7047671351ad314e222de70a60a101ea1ac5b1",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b3793ef5a18692dc7a850d3da3abffe1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第一次超时，是警告；再犯，发球方判一次发球失误，接发方直接丢一分。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "6f6d699f617c6678def5756bc85cbd46ad4ae000916d3c09ebecd46f6252a072",
      "words_sha256": "1b61e49d0481a9ddaee1fa51cbc72ab724db9ff505157cb151654c7c0d6a1eee"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:3bfd66e897cd6a05cfa8fa41bdd096c7f0717e1eb3678c573535a87e09d7c89c",
      "request_id": "3bfd66e897cd6a05cfa8fa41bdd096c7f0717e1eb3678c573535a87e09d7c89c",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5643566f8d0cd00bf2449e20aab4b4fc",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "先看规则。ATP和大满贯的规则都写着：抽筋，不能叫医疗暂停。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d37886bf958f8b8aec1f348c37d6a57d9ac4cdfc7490a68b5cd468d0911096b7",
      "words_sha256": "bb5df577864896b04459daf668a5450a973f17450c049438a2c7086b6479d0b5"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:5d204fe1ac0be900beba544a7e2a4df0b06799c15556645f4d4339a4cfb5abf2",
      "request_id": "5d204fe1ac0be900beba544a7e2a4df0b06799c15556645f4d4339a4cfb5abf2",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5ee2ec364c8aecef5089afefe9152a00",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十月二十号，里昂站首轮，法国人穆泰对阵同胞安贝尔。打到决胜盘，穆泰二比零领先。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "bf36ef304e3d562affe8720f3d2754d5de8eb65bbd1c0e817ebceb3c881c797d",
      "words_sha256": "3103f87e21bad51f4f61612cdf502a457af30be3f23e40bf19f5d37fa2e267d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:6a32ffcd61ad87553ee726114b4fdc919f260e246f3d007d6295d123837690d2",
      "request_id": "6a32ffcd61ad87553ee726114b4fdc919f260e246f3d007d6295d123837690d2",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "2781b230188acf817041d8aba8f79404",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "分与分之间，只有二十五秒。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "89e386136a72d663b4c4d7a9f1922a25042c6cecd1686c636312dd7f3b3cd310",
      "words_sha256": "9a81c6c2128b9bc87c82f0cf0a1805d438d9ed8618f50fc2c9ff3d1629e0d27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:6a92823e5274ad3caf529c30c2aa8b4185c80a61521418a21cb021dd88c5752d",
      "request_id": "6a92823e5274ad3caf529c30c2aa8b4185c80a61521418a21cb021dd88c5752d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "77c0e15f65756a095b00c6df4ea73434",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "医疗暂停之后，他接着打。兹维列夫很不满，认为抽筋不该给医疗暂停。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "4589900ec9b788dc2365fa5295ed6177388124bf3f24bb8b33faedff1d701443",
      "words_sha256": "8e14e888eceb40a22b07900100eeb47b0afa2e60a43c8e4e1eeadf8f36d6e8d7"
    },
    {
