        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "抽筋倒地，为什么还被警告？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "1cb7977fe33e37e2ae945d9b38e689b098c7ab8df0339fdfb04cd788582c0fc2",
      "words_sha256": "6bdca6f256c042ac45c57a4f843c296e42f5a0cf8e2d5364faff21613637a69d"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:80e34a1c1861cbb728f515a3613b08fcca1b025086a6ce2b7ef2c8ee859b2377",
      "request_id": "80e34a1c1861cbb728f515a3613b08fcca1b025086a6ce2b7ef2c8ee859b2377",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e0b4d0f26ed42e1121567083252540c8",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "打完这一分，他突然倒在了地上。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "2015dccd025a28d9e247aa9f5108e7fbd0bf33510c8428a2721eea53e9c7cde0",
      "words_sha256": "4c45946ac92bf9088a916adb67a55df9ac80b06157bd52836dc68b073d2aefbe"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:967c849bc6bfca1785511193cbb1020d2a1a9ab2e57bd54b72a5996992e26448",
      "request_id": "967c849bc6bfca1785511193cbb1020d2a1a9ab2e57bd54b72a5996992e26448",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b9b2905d7bf0c7ec4320e15f8a1479d9",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "一场比赛，抽筋最多治疗两次。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "8931da70a12bba2d27e748ced8d173572e425fd3c2ee45d0bb307e1449360079",
      "words_sha256": "584de10e32c0f49187092edc4659144e1735b55423a3a443495632953b5e6da3"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b5026caaa80c8d99c0a348e2aa9e688e992a36fabea00d83184f28319dcf39cd",
      "request_id": "b5026caaa80c8d99c0a348e2aa9e688e992a36fabea00d83184f28319dcf39cd",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c37f151b725bb9eea18938bcc9d25580",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "规则写得很清楚。可抽筋到倒地，该不该多给几秒？评论区说说。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "fab10baa58e5108d4d629d9384813865af59cde8cc6d1dd5f73cf6a145a61bcd",
      "words_sha256": "8b27e53ddc8bcadef259759821868b682d0943c83a9f5c905bea829cc4588c0b"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b58a6a54c8b59abecb4e7e05a4f77c4c3586add4a1b104be8de8fb2ea4f61679",
      "request_id": "b58a6a54c8b59abecb4e7e05a4f77c4c3586add4a1b104be8de8fb2ea4f61679",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ace074af78583b6f4e806961b2036167",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "阿尔卡拉斯说，他以为是受伤。最后他五盘获胜，打了五小时二十七分钟。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "096929e018d90eb8a046d6cb825959144cea55ab633bffee0ece63aaf49479ba",
      "words_sha256": "b34b6032ce6161a4ee8aa1c8d71d55876069a0fdcf62e65dfcf80d9bd702a655"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "6c98bf97dcb4482a6383180ebf850ffdcb998f341906876f21af7eb48f4dc296",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
