        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十月二十号，里昂站首轮，法国人穆泰对阵同胞安贝尔。打到决胜盘，穆泰二比零领先。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "2015dccd025a28d9e247aa9f5108e7fbd0bf33510c8428a2721eea53e9c7cde0",
      "words_sha256": "4c45946ac92bf9088a916adb67a55df9ac80b06157bd52836dc68b073d2aefbe",
      "words_path": "voice_01.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e0b4d0f26ed42e1121567083252540c8",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "打完这一分，他突然倒在了地上。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "f9a2ceb50c9e235e67164389c872a2aae36bbd393295692fc820193ceaf44333",
      "words_sha256": "77ecf9af15aabe04ef6cf4f956ae054803c5010b24756a3feb285e9ca270b378",
      "words_path": "voice_04.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "aa84275e788a8044bf96c9527a4be6b4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "他被扶了起来，比赛接着打。可主裁还是判他超时，给了一次警告。按规则，抽筋不能叫医疗暂停。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c3ec7bb52982f4ed72ffa6c133a2aabe3a8b58a5d8d97f162d76e65eeb3c56a7",
      "words_sha256": "6ca8f3ed0f3fc27d112a4e2fadc45ca78bab871c7978b06ce56a95014399807e",
      "words_path": "voice_05.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d20290d7f1dd665642eb2a4195d5407f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决胜盘打进抢七，他先零比二落后。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "1fa2d9cc2f5748f73d9c34b56b9da696700a8c36d5797b095f48b12993e16761",
      "words_sha256": "bf3b1cb4432fb79300ed4861d3b6d31bcffdad3015d58e8e68a36760e6a67d62",
      "words_path": "voice_06.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6f51a8eda94757c1e066833ab555d876",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "接下来九分，他拿了七分，七比四赢下抢七。可抽筋倒地，为什么还会被警告？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d37886bf958f8b8aec1f348c37d6a57d9ac4cdfc7490a68b5cd468d0911096b7",
      "words_sha256": "bb5df577864896b04459daf668a5450a973f17450c049438a2c7086b6479d0b5",
      "words_path": "voice_08.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5643566f8d0cd00bf2449e20aab4b4fc",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "先看规则。ATP和大满贯的规则都写着：抽筋，不能叫医疗暂停。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "14795b1e9be16eeaaf16e7c1abd756a7c3ff754a339e29fce47c2e2f89e5ff2c",
      "words_sha256": "5df7f960c851e7894efa92dda027dac2cb520a7358cd236492909a8fa3ebe219",
      "words_path": "voice_09.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5568d07c7c3f709718fc7f70dc917fa0",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "只能在换边的九十秒，或者盘间的一百二十秒里治疗。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "8931da70a12bba2d27e748ced8d173572e425fd3c2ee45d0bb307e1449360079",
      "words_sha256": "584de10e32c0f49187092edc4659144e1735b55423a3a443495632953b5e6da3",
      "words_path": "voice_10.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b9b2905d7bf0c7ec4320e15f8a1479d9",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "一场比赛，抽筋最多治疗两次。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "89e386136a72d663b4c4d7a9f1922a25042c6cecd1686c636312dd7f3b3cd310",
      "words_sha256": "9a81c6c2128b9bc87c82f0cf0a1805d438d9ed8618f50fc2c9ff3d1629e0d27b",
      "words_path": "voice_11.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "2781b230188acf817041d8aba8f79404",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "分与分之间，只有二十五秒。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "6f6d699f617c6678def5756bc85cbd46ad4ae000916d3c09ebecd46f6252a072",
      "words_sha256": "1b61e49d0481a9ddaee1fa51cbc72ab724db9ff505157cb151654c7c0d6a1eee",
      "words_path": "voice_12.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b3793ef5a18692dc7a850d3da3abffe1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第一次超时，是警告；再犯，发球方判一次发球失误，接发方直接丢一分。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "42c260c62f51cc99e40df407441e29727977e6bfc5fa6c7ca4610e389d2aef2d",
      "words_sha256": "7505b968b8955158d308a90cf6657617b0d91e43ae3066218a86e627d19842e0",
      "words_path": "voice_13.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3e196ebb3d2a5ae1581e6d4392a1a79f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "真撑不住，可以先放弃几分、甚至几局，拖到换边再治。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "88a431d8c7b4316a045d03c0c326339afbe73adbf86c9687bfa71cc89657227f",
      "words_sha256": "8a840ca04a1e293fbdbe02770554223ca8a6c69b1e79becfabf307c72c46fc00",
      "words_path": "voice_14.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6e0dcdd193b75daf491686cf1f0a3cbe",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这条规则，不少球员都碰上过。二零二一年迈阿密，梅德韦杰夫第三盘抽筋，一瘸一拐，最后七比六、六比七、六比四赢下波皮林。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d7428c7269dd5ccd97cba7392cf4d715efd5d84cfb808738edfa529ed9d34be4",
      "words_sha256": "f5fa855e27bd19018f79d344175ba3a96c50e7c783756c1cddf5ae4ba6a5731f",
      "words_path": "voice_16.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8d6599ee1432880f25b7f38af2154897",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二二年阿卡普尔科，科兹洛夫对季米特洛夫。第二盘，他打着打着就抽筋了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "95cf510d6dcf064815c8122291f476eb2f3a201b56dddbb8245ead279c63a025",
      "words_sha256": "7eee5db563b95555858a6a2c5d2f02350f7db60f2bb883c7509610ab83daf273",
      "words_path": "voice_19.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b8234f9765bcab407264c3caf669812d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "最后科兹洛夫赢了，打了三小时二十一分钟。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "148bccf7ed68a3f1154430843eceeb291992289f099a7b5e960850ebb9781017",
      "words_sha256": "cb87e28821209d61cb114f1e53f659a2ae774c443d6af939ca0d9889c2b30d20",
      "words_path": "voice_20.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b07648e14901758193d3397abf6eae07",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二五年上海，天气又湿又热，辛纳右腿抽筋。第三盘二比三落后，他选择退赛，和格里克斯普尔握手。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "7ce4f31cc96f204b276c59b7e8247d17b47c6d616388d9e1cc4fd8ae23e8a503",
      "words_sha256": "4ca0f0453cf881bfd1dc29c751eaa9dd0913c7b2f84f149c86e5064b8899919b",
      "words_path": "voice_21.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "665f8d6424f44842a1cd97a669a02de1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "今年澳网半决赛，阿尔卡拉斯对兹维列夫。第三盘，阿尔卡拉斯的腿出了问题，拿到一次医疗暂停。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "4589900ec9b788dc2365fa5295ed6177388124bf3f24bb8b33faedff1d701443",
      "words_sha256": "8e14e888eceb40a22b07900100eeb47b0afa2e60a43c8e4e1eeadf8f36d6e8d7",
      "words_path": "voice_22.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "77c0e15f65756a095b00c6df4ea73434",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "医疗暂停之后，他接着打。兹维列夫很不满，认为抽筋不该给医疗暂停。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "096929e018d90eb8a046d6cb825959144cea55ab633bffee0ece63aaf49479ba",
      "words_sha256": "b34b6032ce6161a4ee8aa1c8d71d55876069a0fdcf62e65dfcf80d9bd702a655",
      "words_path": "voice_23.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ace074af78583b6f4e806961b2036167",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "阿尔卡拉斯说，他以为是受伤。最后他五盘获胜，打了五小时二十七分钟。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "fab10baa58e5108d4d629d9384813865af59cde8cc6d1dd5f73cf6a145a61bcd",
      "words_sha256": "8b27e53ddc8bcadef259759821868b682d0943c83a9f5c905bea829cc4588c0b",
      "words_path": "voice_24.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c37f151b725bb9eea18938bcc9d25580",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "规则写得很清楚。可抽筋到倒地，该不该多给几秒？评论区说说。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_cover.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "1cb7977fe33e37e2ae945d9b38e689b098c7ab8df0339fdfb04cd788582c0fc2",
      "words_sha256": "6bdca6f256c042ac45c57a4f843c296e42f5a0cf8e2d5364faff21613637a69d",
      "words_path": "voice_cover.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "130f0ad6abeb2344f7165d82e13d42e1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "抽筋倒地，为什么还被警告？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_outro.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "6c98bf97dcb4482a6383180ebf850ffdcb998f341906876f21af7eb48f4dc296",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8",
      "words_path": "voice_outro.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    }
  ]
}
